### Compose Multiplatform modules ###
# Unanchored on purpose: `/build` at the top of this file matches only the root project's own
# directory, and the per-module list that used to sit here (`/shared/build`, `/desktopApp/build`)
# went stale the moment Phase 2 added `:core`, `:ui-shell`, `:features-api:*` and `:features:*` —
# 10k+ generated dex/klib files became "untracked work" that one `git add -A` would have committed
# (known-issues #1's shape). `build/` with no leading slash matches a directory of that name at any
# depth, so a module added later is covered without an edit here. Safe because nothing tracked lives
# under any `build/` in this repo — check with `git ls-files | grep -E '(^|/)build/'` before adding
# a file there. (:app keeps its own app/.gitignore for the same reason in the other direction.)
build/

